#: org.kde.audiotube.appdata.xml:9
#. (itstool) path: component/name
msgid "AudioTube"
msgstr "ऑडियोट्यूब"

#: org.kde.audiotube.appdata.xml:10
#. (itstool) path: component/summary
msgid "YouTube Music app"
msgstr "YouTube Music app"

#: org.kde.audiotube.appdata.xml:107
#. (itstool) path: description/p
msgid ""
"AudioTube can search YouTube Music, list albums and artists, play "
"automatically generated playlists, albums and allows to put your own "
"playlist together. It is adapted to mobile phones and desktop computers."
msgstr ""
"AudioTube YouTube Music अन्वेष्टुं शक्नोति, एल्बमान् कलाकारान् च सूचीतुं "
"शक्नोति, स्वयमेव उत्पन्नं प्लेलिस्ट्, एल्बम् वादयितुं शक्नोति तथा च स्वस्य "
"प्लेलिस्ट् एकत्र स्थापयितुं शक्नोति। इदं मोबाईलफोनेषु, डेस्कटॉप् सङ्गणकेषु "
"च अनुकूलितम् अस्ति ।"
